# held/props/reed: the shawm for the Flute posture's Reed variant: a dark wooden pipe widening to a flared bell, held bell down (PROPS, P2b). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. At the mouth (pose arms: mouth), anchored on
# the right shoulder; before the face on the beard layer facing down, behind the far hand facing left, hidden from behind.
